OL,3,AUS actor Chad Lowe 'heartbroken' by
OL,4,Adeath of daughter Fiona aged 13
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS actor Chad Lowe and his wife,
OL,7,Fproducer Kim Painter, have said they
OL,8,Fare "deeply heartbroken" following the
OL,9,Fdeath of their "beloved" 13-year-old
OL,10,Fdaughter Fiona.
OL,12,F"She was a loving young girl who was
OL,13,Fsmart, creative and loved to dance,"
OL,14,Fthe family said in a statement to Page
OL,15,FSix and People.
OL,17,F"She was adored by her sisters and she
OL,18,Fwas deeply loved by her parents. In
OL,19,Ffact, she was the light of our lives.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
