OL,3,AOasis take legal action to stop sale of
OL,4,Aunheard tapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA set of unheard Oasis recordings
OL,7,Fvalued at between #1.2m and #1.6m have
OL,8,Fbeen pulled from an auction after the
OL,9,Fband filed an injunction.
OL,11,FEarlier this month, it was announced
OL,12,Fthat Littleton Auctions, in Evesham,
OL,13,Fwere selling a set of recordings which
OL,14,Fincluded 63 live shows, as well as
OL,15,Fsoundchecks and more than 100 hours of
OL,16,FNoel and Liam Gallagher in the 1990s.
OL,18,FThey were collected by Oasis sound
OL,19,Fengineer Huw Richards, who worked with
OL,20,Fthe band from the release of their
OL,21,Fdebut album Definitely, Maybe in 1994,
OL,22,Funtil 2001.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
