OL,3,AFirst Glastonbury 2027 tickets to go on
OL,4,Asale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose hoping to go to Glastonbury
OL,7,FFestival 2027 could soon find out their
OL,8,Ffate as the first set of tickets go on
OL,9,Fsale.
OL,11,FThe event will take place from 23-27
OL,12,FJune 2027 at Worthy Farm in Pilton,
OL,13,FSomerset, after a fallow year in 2026.
OL,15,FCoach tickets will be available to buy
OL,16,Ffor #408 plus the selected coach fare
OL,17,Fat 18:00 BST on Thursday, before
OL,18,Fgeneral admission tickets go on sale at
OL,19,F09:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
